Modifications to the OpenSWMM 6 engine, by Robert Dickinson (SWMM5-UI).

Base:  https://github.com/HydroCouple/openswmm.engine, branch swmm6_rel
       (Apache License, Version 2.0 - NOT the MIT-licensed main branch)
Dates: Emscripten build fixes 2026-08-09; consolidated LID report 2026-08-13

Every file below gains a change notice at the top of the file, as required by
Apache-2.0 section 4(b), so the notice travels with the applied sources and not
just with this patch. Existing copyright and USEPA-provenance headers are left
intact (section 4(c)). What and why, per file:
swmm-engine/patches/MODIFICATIONS.md

git apply ignores this preamble. Upstream has moved on since this patch was
cut, so it applies with offsets - use  patch -p1 --forward  rather than
git apply, and check for rejects.

