+// NEW FILE, not part of upstream HydroCouple/openswmm.engine. Added to the
+// swmm6_rel tree by Robert Dickinson (SWMM5-UI) on 2026-08-13: consolidated
+// detailed LID report (one .lid file covering every reporting LID unit).
